Starlight includes code and device tables adapted from the MIT-licensed
LEDnetWF Home Assistant integration:

  https://github.com/8none1/lednetwf_ble
  Copyright (c) 8none1 and contributors

The reused parts are the ZGHB single-segment frame used on BLE version
below 8, the 27-byte manufacturer-data layout, the RGB / CCT / addressable
command bytes (opcodes 0x31, 0x3B, 0x38, 0x42, 0x61, and 0x73), the 0x81
state parser, and the product and command tables under
custom_components/starlight/data/.

Those files keep their MIT terms. The stair-light commands (products 198
and 532) are original to this project.

The original license text is in LICENSE.
